   "sql": "-- Q4: CVEs both the filer and the NVD scored with CVSS 3.1 (train, development and shadow\n-- windows), how often each base metric and the band agree, by filer type.\nselect\n    filer_type,\n    count(*) as cves,\n    avg(cast(nvd_av = filer_av as integer)) as agree_av,\n    avg(cast(nvd_ac = filer_ac as integer)) as agree_ac,\n    avg(cast(nvd_pr = filer_pr as integer)) as agree_pr,\n    avg(cast(nvd_ui = filer_ui as integer)) as agree_ui,\n    avg(cast(nvd_s = filer_s as integer)) as agree_s,\n    avg(cast(nvd_c = filer_c as integer)) as agree_c,\n    avg(cast(nvd_i = filer_i as integer)) as agree_i,\n    avg(cast(nvd_a = filer_a as integer)) as agree_a,\n    avg(cast(nvd_band = filer_band as integer)) as agree_band\nfrom gold.mart_filer_vs_nvd\ngroup by filer_type\norder by cves desc",
